claim reasoning-state
  Persistent reasoning state for this agent session.

observation session-start
  Persistent reasoning state was initialized for this agent session.

claim current-goal
  Complete the two-step diagnostic task:
  1. Record the plan in persistent reasoning state and read it back to confirm storage.
  2. Create /tmp/smoke.txt containing exactly the word READY.
  Then reply with the single word READY.

claim constraints
  Do not modify anything in /app; do not run the test suite; do not make any git commit.

claim current-hypothesis
  The task is a smoke test of reasoning-state and filesystem write capabilities.

claim superseded-none
  No belief has been superseded.

action plan-recorded
  Plan recorded in revision 1 and read back in revision 2; storage confirmed (content matches exactly).

action smoke-file-created
  /tmp/smoke.txt created containing exactly READY (verified via cat; no trailing newline added).

action task-complete
  Both diagnostic steps completed; /app untouched, no tests run, no git commit made. Final reply: READY.

question resolved-none
  All task requirements verified; no unresolved questions remain.

claim uncertainty
  None; all steps confirmed.

part-of reasoning-state
  session-start
  current-goal
  constraints
  current-hypothesis
  superseded-none
  plan-recorded
  smoke-file-created
  task-complete
  resolved-none
  uncertainty

agent holds current-goal
  confidence 1.0
